{"speciesId":383,"names":{"fr":"Groudon","es":"Groudon","en":"Groudon","ja":"グラードン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"GROUDON has long been described in mythology as the POKéMON that raised lands and expanded continents. This POKéMON took to sleep after a cataclysmic battle with KYOGRE."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"GROUDON has the power to scatter rain clouds and make water evaporate with light and heat. It came as a savior to people who had been suffering from terrible floods."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"GROUDON has appeared in mythology as the creator of the land. It sleeps in magma underground and is said to make volcanoes erupt on awakening."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"This legendary POKéMON is said to represent the land. It went to sleep after dueling KYOGRE."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"This legendary POKéMON is said to represent the land. It went to sleep after dueling KYOGRE."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It had been asleep in underground magma ever since it fiercely fought KYOGRE long ago."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It had been asleep in underground magma ever since it fiercely fought KYOGRE long ago."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It had been asleep in underground magma ever since it fiercely fought KYOGRE long ago."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Said to have expanded the lands by evaporating water with raging heat. It battled titanically with KYOGRE."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Said to have expanded the lands by evaporating water with raging heat. It battled titanically with KYOGRE."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il dormait dans le magma souterrain depuis sa lutte féroce contre Kyogre, il y a longtemps de cela."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It had been asleep in underground magma ever since it fiercely fought Kyogre long ago."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il dormait dans le magma souterrain depuis sa lutte féroce contre Kyogre, il y a longtemps de cela."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It had been asleep in underground magma ever since it fiercely fought Kyogre long ago."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It had been asleep in underground magma ever since it fiercely fought Kyogre long ago."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It had been asleep in underground magma ever since it fiercely fought Kyogre long ago."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ennemi juré de Kyogre, sa haute chaleur corporelle aurait fait évaporer l’eau et permis aux continents de s’étendre."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Dicen que aumentó la superficie terrestre evaporando el agua. Fue un enemigo acérrimo de Kyogre."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Said to have expanded the lands by evaporating water with raging heat. It battled titanically with Kyogre."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"高熱で 水を 蒸発させて 大地を 広げたと 言われている。 カイオーガと 激しく 戦った。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ce Pokémon légendaire incarne la terre. Il plongea dans un profond sommeil après son combat avec Kyogre."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Dicen que este Pokémon legendario simboliza la tierra. Tras batirse en duelo con Kyogre se echó a dormir."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"This legendary Pokémon is said to represent the land. It went to sleep after dueling Kyogre."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"カイオーガと 死闘の末 長い 眠りに ついた。大地の 化身と 言われる 伝説の ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Un Pokémon considéré comme l’avatar des continents. Selon les légendes, il a disputé de nombreux combats avec Kyogre pour contrôler l’énergie de la nature."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"A Groudon siempre se le ha descrito como el Pokémon que expandió los continentes. Varias leyendas cuentan que libró combates contra Kyogre en repetidas ocasiones para tener el control de la energía de la naturaleza."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Groudon is said to be the personification of the land itself. Legends tell of its many clashes against Kyogre, as each sought to gain the power of nature."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"大地の 化身 と 伝わる ポケモン。 自然のエネルギーを 求めて カイオーガと 争いを 繰り返したという 伝説が ある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Grâce à l’énergie de la nature, il peut accomplir sa Primo-Résurgence pour retrouver son apparence originelle. Ce pouvoir lui permet de créer du magma pour étendre les continents."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Groudon se sirve de la energía de la naturaleza para realizar su Regresión Primigenia y recobrar su apariencia primitiva. Con tal poder, puede crear magma para expandir los continentes."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Through Primal Reversion and with nature’s full power, it will take back its true form. It can cause magma to erupt and expand the landmass of the world."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"自然のエネルギーに よって ゲンシカイキし 本来の 姿を 取り戻す。その力は マグマを 生みだし 大地を 広げる。"}],"varieties":[{"id":383,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"mach